  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth leader - providing support for RESPEKT 2.0</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Youth Leaders (YL) will work on the project RESPEKT 2.0, which is a partnership project funded by DUF working to increase awareness of and education on sexual and reproductive health and rights (SRHR) amongst teenagers in Kenya. The aim of the Youth Leader Exchange (YLE) is to strengthen and stabilise the newly launched RESPEKT Clubs and work to support the working groups. The YLs also aim to establish a beneficial collaboration with partners who have been working closely with RESPEKT, these partners will work closely with the Project Coordination Teams to host RESPEKT Conference 2023 (Wajibu Wetu Summits)</narrative>
  </description>
